From: sunshineinabox <aqemail@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 19:57:03 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] wlroots: offload the output rotation to the primary plane


diff -ruN pristine/backend/drm/atomic.c stepA/backend/drm/atomic.c
--- a/backend/drm/atomic.c	2026-03-19 12:13:09
